einstein","start":1991,"end":1999,"desc":"El término viene de una canción de Venom, pero en los noventa ya no designa una temática sino un estilo sonoro nacido en Noruega con Mayhem y Burzum: sobre una base de death metal añade capas de teclados cósmicos, voces chirriantes y músicos pintados de cadáver. Sus fundadores se tomaban en serio el satanismo: profanaciones de cementerios, iglesias quemadas y asesinatos que, como los antecedentes de los gangsta rappers, le dieron un aire de autenticidad. Crece exponencialmente en el norte de Europa (Emperor y Dimmu Borgir ya cruzan el Atlántico) y a su vez se fragmenta hacia lo new age (Tiamat, Burzum) o hacia el gótico (Cradle of Filth, Theatre of Tragedy).","color":"#94a3b8","family":"Metal extremo: death, black y grind","link":"https://volteret4.github.io/HeavyMetal/#black-metal-noruego"}],"book_tracks":[],"mentions":[],"podcast":[{"kind":"podcast","title":"Admiration for Dark Wave Neoclassical","body":"Varg Vikernes acknowledged his admiration for Anglo-Saxon dark music derived from post-punk, specifically Dark Wave Neoclassical artists like Dead Can Dance and Death in June, which notably influenced the atmospheric approach of some of his works. \"Entre ellos, el propio Wurzum, que reconoció su admiración por estas propuestas.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"Dungeon Synth: El género más misterioso de internet","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CBIHO0ihIxQ"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Imprisonment of Varg Vikernes","body":"Varg Vikernes was sent to prison for several years following the 1993 murder of Euronymous, leader of Mayhem. During his incarceration, he recorded what are known as his \"prison albums.\" \"Este suceso envió a Bekerne esa prisión durante varios años.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"Central Sonora","episode":"Dungeon Synth: El género más misterioso de internet","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CBIHO0ihIxQ"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Murder of Mayhem Member","body":"Vargh Vikernes of the band Burzum was convicted for stabbing a member of the rival band Mayhem 23 times, which resulted in the victim's death. For this crime, he was sentenced to 21 years in jail. \"Vargh Vicarans of the band Burzum stabbed a guy in a rival band called Mayhem 23 times. And yes, he died.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"You're Going to Jail!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6xygY-npCr4"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[{"kind":"xref","title":"Member's Murder by Rival Band Member","body":"A member of the band Mayhem was murdered by Vargh Vikernes of Burzum, who stabbed the victim 23 times. \"Vargh Vicarans of the band Burzum stabbed a guy in a rival band called Mayhem 23 times. And yes, he died.\"","year":null,"extra":{"from":"Mayhem","from_id":198539801269541,"type":"curiosity"},"srcs":[{"source":"The Ongoing History of New Music","episode":"You're Going to Jail!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6xygY-npCr4"}]}],"charts":[{"id":276965120892456,"type":"album","name":"Burzum","list_id":55316938071026,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1992","src":"musthear","rank":179,"year":1992,"note":null,"yt":"3DUoe_QnUgQ","scaruffi":null},{"id":18761160826945,"type":"album","name":"Det Som Engang Var","list_id":211662551972869,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Atmospheric Black Metal","src":"musthear","rank":129,"year":1993,"note":null,"yt":"t0wtElYWHW4","scaruffi":null},{"id":18761160826945,"type":"album","name":"Det Som Engang Var","work_year":1993,"list_id":59251635065665,"list":"Sputnikmusic Best Albums 1993","src":"charts","rank":121,"year":1993,"note":null,"yt":"t0wtElYWHW4","scaruffi":null},{"id":92152574070317,"type":"album","name":"Hvis Lyset Tar Oss","list_id":211662551972869,"list":"RYM Top — Rock — Atmospheric Black Metal","src":"musthear","rank":9,"year":1994,"note":null,"yt":"Z2TlkRa-N1Q","scaruffi":7.0},{"id":92152574070317,"type":"album","name":"Hv